    'about.kicker':'Inkundla','about.title':'Yini i-Streaming on F.A.M.E?',
    'about.lead':'I-F.A.M.E iyisevisi yokusakaza <b>i-Over-The-Top (VOD)</b> eyasungulwa ngu-<b>Matodzi Makananisa</b>, ekomkhulu e-Johannesburg futhi isebenzela sonke isifunda saseNingizimu ye-Afrika.',
    'about.p1':'Umgomo wethu ulula: <b>ukujabulisa nokuhlomisa i-Afrika.</b> Sakha okuqukethwe okuletha ukujabulisa ngakolunye uhlangothi nokuhlomisa ngakolunye — ngezinhlelo zethu zangempela eziklanyelwe ukusiza intsha ukubhekana nokuntuleka kwemisebenzi, ukuqala amabhizinisi nokudala imisebenzi emiphakathini yayo.',
    'about.p2':'Inzuzo yethu yokuncintisana ifihliwe egekeni elinganakwa abanye: <b>okuningi ngenani elincane.</b> I-Live TV, izinhlelo ezifunwa ngesikhathi sakho nokuqukethwe kwendawo — konke ngenani elilodwa elincane, ngaphandle kwezindleko ezifihliwe, inqubo ecacile yokukhansela kanye nocingo lwe-WhatsApp oluqondile.',
    'about.tag1':'Ama-Original ase-Afrika','about.tag2':'Intengo ekholekayo','about.tag3':'Amandla Amnyama','about.tag4':'Ukudala imisebenzi','about.tag5':'Izindaba zase-Afrika yonke',
    'facts.founded':'Yasungulwa','facts.hq':'Ikomkhulu','facts.launch':'Iqala','facts.region':'Indawo esebenzayo','facts.jobs':'Imisebenzi ngonyaka 1','facts.titles':'Okuqukethwe ekusungulweni',

    'founder.kicker':'Umsunguli','founder.title':'Hlangana no-Matodzi Makananisa.','founder.role':'Umsunguli · Streaming on F.A.M.E',
    'founder.lead':'UMatodzi Makananisa ungumsunguli we-<b>Streaming on F.A.M.E</b>. Kusukela ngo-2015 — ngenkathi umkhiqizo we-F.A.M.E uqala njengenkundla yemiklomelo yokuzijabulisa — uMatodzi ubelokhu esakhela umbono owodwa: <b>ukujabulisa nokuhlomisa i-Afrika</b>.',
    'founder.p1':'Ngaphansi kobuholi bakhe, i-F.A.M.E ikhiqiza izinhlelo zangempela "ze-Black Power" ezinikeza intsha amathuluzi okubhekana nokuntuleka kwemisebenzi, ukuqala amabhizinisi nokudala imisebenzi emiphakathini yayo. Isevisi yokusakaza kulindeleke ukuthi idale cishe <b>imisebenzi engu-300</b> onyakeni wayo wokuqala wezimali.',
    'founder.p2':'UMatodzi uchaza ifilosofi ye-F.A.M.E ngokusobala: <em>"Ukukhokha ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi yi-Black Power."</em> Isitatimende senhloso — ukuthi ukuzijabulisa, uma kwenziwa kahle, kungaba yisisetshenziswa sokuhlomisa umnotho kulo lonke izwekazi.',
    'founder.pillar1.t':'Umgomo','founder.pillar1.d':'Ukujabulisa nokuhlomisa i-Afrika.',
    'founder.pillar2.t':'Umbono','founder.pillar2.d':'Umxoxi nomhambisi wendaba wase-Afrika #1.',
