    'waitlist.sub':'Joyina uhlu lokulinda futhi sizokwazisa ngesikhathi siqala — kanye nezaphulelo zakuqala nezindaba zangemuva.',
    'waitlist.cta':'Ngazise','waitlist.note':'Sizokuthumela i-imeyili kuphela nge-F.A.M.E. Kuhambisana ne-POPIA. Ungayeka noma nini.','waitlist.count':'abantu ohlwini',

    'faq.kicker':'Udinga ukwazi?','faq.title':'Imibuzo evamile',
    'faq.q1':'Yini i-Streaming on F.A.M.E?','faq.a1':'Ikhaya laseNingizimu Afrika lokuzijabulisa kwendawo. I-F.A.M.E iyinkundla yokubuka ividiyo esekelwe kuselula ehlanganisa ama-original ase-Afrika, uchungechunge, amafilimu, ama-documentary, i-reality, okuqukethwe kwezingane, umculo nemidlalo ebukhoma — ngenani elikholekayo lanyanga zonke.',
    'faq.q2':'Iqala nini?','faq.a2':'Umgomo wethu ukuqaliswa komphakathi okugcwele ngo-<b>1 Juni 2027</b>, kulandela isikhathi sokuthuthukiswa kusukela ngo-Okthoba 2026 kuya ku-Februwari 2027. Amalungu ohlulokulinda athola ukufinyelela kuqala.',
    'faq.q3':'Kubiza malini?','faq.a3':'Izinhlelo ezimbili: <b>R29.90/ngenyanga</b> (esekelwa izikhangiso) ne-<b>R39.90/ngenyanga</b> (akunazikhangiso). Azikho izindleko ezifihliwe, azikho izivumelwano, khansela noma nini.',
    'faq.q4':'Yini engingayibuka ku-Streaming on F.A.M.E?','faq.a4':'I-Reality TV, ama-animation, ama-documentary, uchungechunge, amafilimu, amavidiyo omculo, amafilimu amafushane, imicimbi ebukhoma, okuqukethwe kwezingane nezinhlelo zemfundo — ngokugxila okuqinile kuma-original ase-Afrika.',
    'faq.q5':'Yimaphi amadivayisi asekelwayo?','faq.a5':'Ekusungulweni: iwebhu yeselula (PWA) nohlelo lwe-Android. Isigaba sesibili sengeza i-iOS, iwebhu ye-desktop nezinhlelo ze-Smart TV.',
    'faq.q6':'Ingabe kukhona ukuzibophezela lapho ubhalisa?','faq.a6':'Lutho nhlobo. Azikho izibopho futhi ungakhansela noma nini, kusebenza ekupheleni kwesikhathi sakho samanje sokukhokha.',
    'faq.q7':'Ngingabelana nge-akhawunti yami nomndeni?','faq.a7':'Yebo — i-akhawunti ngayinye isekela kuze kube amaphrofayili ama-2, kanye nephrofayili yezingane evikelwe nge-PIN.',
    'faq.q8':'Ngabe kuzoba nezihumusho?','faq.a8':'Yebo. Imibhalo engezansi yesiNgisi nama-captions avaliwe ayatholakala kulo lonke uhlu lwezihloko, nezinye izilimi zesifunda ezihlelelwe.',
    'faq.q9':'Ngithola kanjani ukwesekwa?','faq.a9':'Ngocingo lwe-WhatsApp oluqondile lwamakhasimende — abantu bangempela, azikho izikhungo zocingo. Imininingwane izoshicilelwa ekusungulweni.',
    'faq.q10':'Yimaphi amazwe ezotholakala kuwo?','faq.a10':'Sonke isifunda saseNingizimu ye-Afrika: iNingizimu Afrika, iLesotho, i-Eswatini, iBotswana, iMozambique, iNamibia, iZimbabwe, iZambia, iMalawi ne-Angola.',

    'mission.kicker':'Umgomo wethu','mission.title1':'Ukujabulisa','mission.title2':'nokuhlomisa i-Afrika.',
    'mission.p1':'I-Streaming on F.A.M.E yakhelwe ukuxoxa izindaba zase-Afrika yonke: isizinda sokuzijabulisa esiphilayo, esikholekayo esibeka abadali bendawo, amazwi nezindaba phakathi kulwazi.',
    'mission.p2':'Umbono wethu ukuba <b>umxoxi nomhambisi wendaba wase-Afrika #1.</b> Lokho kusho ukutshala imali kokuqukethwe kwangempela, ukudala cishe imisebenzi engu-300 onyakeni wethu wokuqala wezimali, nokusekela lonke uchungechunge lwenani lokukhiqiza lwe-TV namafilimu.',

